Result: partly. P1 and P2 hit (x 0.113, heading -35). c0 is nearly inert.

### H4: c2, c3, c4 held together change how c1 = -1 moves the body

WHEN c1 is held at -1 and c2, c3, c4 are all held at 1, THE system SHALL end with x above 0.2 m.

```prediction
[[prediction]]
id = "P1"
measurement = "x"
range = [0.2, 1.5]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a0 = 0.0
a1 = -1.0
a2 = 1.0
a3 = 1.0
a4 = 1.0
```

Result: rejected. With c2, c3, c4 = +1 and c1 = -1: x 0.062. With all three at -1: x -0.26, with a forward push of about 0.2 m/s for 1.5 s and a turn of about -45 deg/s.

### H5: Dropping c4 from the c2, c3, c4 = -1 drive reduces the turn and keeps the forward push

WHEN c1 = -1, c2 = -1, c3 = -1 and c0, c4 are 0 for the whole trial, THE system SHALL end with x above 0.2 m.

